Subject: [PATCH 6/6] extension file naming: files renamed to the extended
 type's own name or the 'T where <clause>' shape (renames only; Linux x86_64,
 Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 ....swift => __Set where S is Store.`Protocol` & ~Copyable.swift} | 0
 .../{Set.Protocol+defaults.swift => __SetProtocol.swift}          | 0
 Sources/Set/{Set+Columns.swift => __Set.swift}                    | 0
 3 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename Sources/Set Protocol/{Set.Index.swift => __Set where S is Store.`Protocol` & ~Copyable.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Set Protocol/{Set.Protocol+defaults.swift => __SetProtocol.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Set/{Set+Columns.swift => __Set.swift} (100%)

diff --git a/Sources/Set Protocol/Set.Index.swift b/Sources/Set Protocol/__Set where S is Store.`Protocol` & ~Copyable.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Set Protocol/Set.Index.swift
rename to Sources/Set Protocol/__Set where S is Store.`Protocol` & ~Copyable.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Set Protocol/Set.Protocol+defaults.swift b/Sources/Set Protocol/__SetProtocol.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Set Protocol/Set.Protocol+defaults.swift
rename to Sources/Set Protocol/__SetProtocol.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Set/Set+Columns.swift b/Sources/Set/__Set.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Set/Set+Columns.swift
rename to Sources/Set/__Set.swift
